{"step_index":904,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:30:33Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T01:30:33+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T01:30:33+02:00\nFile Path: `file:///mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_2a2555cc/scratch.lean`\nTotal Lines: 18\nTotal Bytes: 751\nShowing lines 1 to 18\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: import Mathlib\n2: import LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\n3: \n4: open SimpleGraph\n5: \n6: lemma ballWithin_subset_succ {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V] (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (k : ℕ) (v : V) :\n7:     GraphCalc.ballWithin G k v ⊆ GraphCalc.ballWithin G (k + 1) v := by\n8:   dsimp [GraphCalc.ballWithin]\n9:   exact Finset.subset_union_left\n10: \n11: lemma ballWithin_mono {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V] (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\n12:     (v : V) {k m : ℕ} (h : k ≤ m) : GraphCalc.ballWithin G k v ⊆ GraphCalc.ballWithin G m v := by\n13:   obtain ⟨d, rfl⟩ := Nat.exists_eq_add_of_le h\n14:   induction d with\n15:   | zero => exact Finset.Subset.refl _\n16:   | succ d' ih =>\n17:     exact Finset.Subset.trans ih (ballWithin_subset_succ G (k + d') v)\n18: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
{"step_index":905,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:30:33Z","thinking":"**Understanding the Induction Hypothesis**\n\nThe induction hypothesis, `ih`, has the type `k ≤ k + d' → ...` because the induction is performed on `d`.  The goal is to prove something about a variable `m`, but in the induction step `m` is represented as `k + d'`, where `d'` is the inductive variable. The lemma `Nat.exists_eq_add_of_le h` provides `d` such that `m = k + d` which explains the type.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean","Cwd":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_2a2555cc","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolAction":"Checking scratch.lean","toolSummary":"Run check.sh on scratch.lean"}}]}
